Package: cfd.legacyreborn.gcpassesfix
Name: GCPassesFix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fixes Game Center sign-in and the Passbook (Passes) app on jailbroken legacy iOS. Bundles up-to-date root certificates, resets the stale Game Center / iTunes Store / Setup state (reversibly) so the device signs in clean, and patches PassKit to accept unsigned, edited or expired passes. Methods from the bag.xml guides; Passbook fix based on SigPass (GPLv3).
Maintainer: LegacyReborn
Author: LegacyReborn
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 5.0), firmware (<< 8.0)
Conflicts: bag.xml.sigpass
Replaces: bag.xml.sigpass
Icon: file:///Library/PreferenceBundles/GCPassesFixPrefs.bundle/icon@2x.png
